    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d440-a1">

                <pb facs="0997" n="901" sameAs="frus:frus1879/pg901"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1 in No.
                    248.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article</hi> 1. The duties on tobacco, established by
                    article 1 of the law of April 1, 1871, are substituted by the following: <table
                        cols="2" rows="4">
                        <row role="label">
                            <cell>Tobacco in rolls, each kilo</cell>
                            <cell role="num">1$440</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Tobacco in leaf, each kilo</cell>
                            <cell role="num">1$680</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Tobacco in cheroots (cigars), each kilo</cell>
                            <cell role="num">2$640</cell>
                        </row>
                        <row>
                            <cell>Tobacco, all other manufactures, each kilo</cell>
                            <cell role="num">2$160</cell>
                        </row>
                    </table></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Article</hi> 2. The impost is re-established of 2,000
                    reis on every 50,000 reis on licenses for the sale of tobacco, which shall be in
                    force agreeably to the law of May 13, 1864, thus being revoked the twenty-first
                    article of May 14, 1872, and also abolished the industrial tax on the sale of
                    tobaccos.</p>
            </div>
        </body>
